meta {
  name: Get cached modem-native IMS observation
  type: http
  seq: 180
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/modem/lines/{{line_id}}/native/ims/status
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Authenticated cached read only. Does not discover hardware, send AT/QMI, enable URCs or alter host IMS.
  adapter_available describes the installed native provider/topology, not firmware qualification or registration.
  sample is sequential, timestamped modem evidence; registration_reporting/service_reporting are reported flags.
  unknown_or_unreported (including raw zero) is not a definitive unregistered/unavailable state. Final service is UT, not video.
  Cached samples are hidden after SIM/owner/host-access changes and stale after 30 seconds. They never grant SIP/business readiness.
}
